# Rendered media. Big, binary, and reproducible from the scripts in this repo
# (gameshots.py -> promo/shot-*.mp4, harvest_stills.py -> store/stills/).
# Git keeps every version of a binary forever, so ~140 MB of MP4s would bloat
# the clone permanently for something a re-render regenerates.
# `promo/` is ignored for the MEDIA. QUEUE.md and POSTED.md live there too and
# are hand-kept text that no script regenerates - two routines read them, so
# losing them loses the marketing state. Git will not descend into an ignored
# DIRECTORY, so the pattern has to be `promo/*` for the negations to work.
promo/*
!promo/QUEUE.md
!promo/POSTED.md
store/stills/
gallery/
shots/panels/
shots/workspace.png
gif/frames/

# build output
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.coverage

# run logs
e2e.log
*.log

# per-version gate output
versions.log
gui_versions.log
first_run.log
gif/palette.png
_posters/
MARKETING.html
_posters/
MARKETING.html
gif/_assets.json

# Render sweeps for the store background: 4-6 MB PNGs, one keeper each.
store/theme/_bg_src/

# Local backups of settings files, made by hand before an edit: machine safety
# net, never repo history.
*.bak-*
